{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And the earth opened its mouth.</b> It widened the fissure as far as the place of their houses." "<b>And all the men who belonged to Korah.</b> All the men who belonged to Korah — those drawn after him in his schism. Therefore his sons did not die, for they were not drawn after him in this." "<b>And all the property.</b> So that the wicked would not merit benefiting the righteous through their toil, in the manner of: a rock fell from his lap and a poor man found it and was sustained by it."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:13.309976060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}